    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Sure. So, yes, an underactive thyroid is known to us, good to have that clear. Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?",
